{
    "background_story": "Cyrus was a charismatic bartender with a flair for the dramatic. He worked at a trendy cocktail bar in the city, where he was known for his elaborate concoctions and infectious charm. One night, a customer challenged him to create a drink using Galliano, a sweet and herbal liqueur. Cyrus accepted the challenge and crafted a masterpiece, combining Galliano with citrus and spices to create a unique and tantalizing flavor profile. The drink, dubbed 'Cyrus's Galliano Glamour,' quickly became a signature cocktail at the bar, attracting patrons from all over the city. Cyrus's creativity and showmanship earned him a reputation as one of the top bartenders in town, and his Galliano Glamour remained a beloved favorite among regulars and newcomers alike.",
